[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:04.260",
    "text": "我都说我小二了，你怎么",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": "00:00:08.780",
    "end": "00:00:30.170",
    "text": "这是我们今天第一次培养感情，还满意吗？老公，哎，我不过就是亲了你一下，你怎么这么大反应，该不会你没经验吧。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": "00:00:31.340",
    "end": "00:00:32.880",
    "text": "怎么可能。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": "00:00:32.910",
    "end": "00:00:36.330",
    "text": "是吗，看起来不像。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": "00:00:39.560",
    "end": "00:00:40.520",
    "text": "南昭宁。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": "00:00:41.070",
    "end": "00:00:41.530",
    "text": "嗯。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": "00:00:41.670",
    "end": "00:00:44.540",
    "text": "现在立刻，从我身上下去。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": "00:00:45.530",
    "end": "00:00:52.310",
    "text": "好嘞老公，那我先去洗漱了，有什么事记得叫我。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": "00:00:57.460",
    "end": "00:01:06.290",
    "text": "我刚才亲了京硕，就算一年后他要死我也赚，南昭宁不愧是你。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": "00:01:10.530",
    "end": "00:01:11.390",
    "text": "变态。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": "00:01:13.300",
    "end": "00:01:22.350",
    "text": "这项玩偶放这，哎师傅辛苦了，这是易碎品轻拿，麻烦快点收拾完我还要去见京硕奶奶呢。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": "00:01:25.590",
    "end": "00:01:46.050",
    "text": "昭昭啊，你和阿硕啊已经结婚了，这些呢都是奶奶给你的改口礼，这两套房啊，地势和装修都不错，回头啊我让人带你去过个户，这些珠宝呢都是早前我拍来的，你年轻带着玩。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": "00:01:46.520",
    "end": "00:01:51.960",
    "text": "奶奶，这些都太贵重了，您之前已经给了我很多了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": "00:01:52.070",
    "end": "00:02:04.000",
    "text": "昭昭啊，阿硕两年前出了车祸才变成这样的，他不爱跟别人接触，所以你们的婚礼也没办，是我们京家委屈你了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": "00:02:04.030",
    "end": "00:02:08.730",
    "text": "太奶奶，这个女人就是冲着咱们家钱来的，她有什么好委屈的。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": "00:02:09.020",
    "end": "00:02:09.730",
    "text": "欣然。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": "00:02:10.500",
    "end": "00:02:14.110",
    "text": "之前的时候给了那么多，今天又给，她凭什么。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": "00:02:14.220",
    "end": "00:02:18.770",
    "text": "喜欢钱又怎么了，谁不喜欢呐，你不喜欢吗？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": "00:02:18.790",
    "end": "00:02:30.370",
    "text": "我，对啊，你花的钱还少吗，给你买的这些盲盒周边小卡花的钱还少啊，昭昭是你的小婶，要有规矩。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": "00:02:30.510",
    "end": "00:02:37.070",
    "text": "她才不是我小婶，小叔又不喜欢她，小叔喜欢的明明是许黛青姐姐。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": "00:02:37.080",
    "end": "00:02:37.640",
    "text": "闭嘴。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": "00:02:40.320",
    "end": "00:02:45.770",
    "text": "许黛青，在京硕高中时期。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": "00:02:50.420",
    "end": "00:02:52.540",
    "text": "许黛青就一直在他身边。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": "00:02:52.550",
    "end": "00:02:54.440",
    "text": "京硕，给。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": "00:03:04.370",
    "end": "00:03:13.040",
    "text": "那就是京硕的青梅竹马许黛青吧，他们俩可是门当户对，听说毕业之后，还要一起出国留学呢。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "",
    "voice": "",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  }
]